# Authentication

### Register a customer
# Needs an activation code from a librarian (admin/customers.http)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "activationCode": "ABCD-1234",
  "email": "customer1@example.com",
  "password": "customer123"
}

###

### Login as librarian (credentials from .env.example)
POST http://localhost:8080/admin/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

email = admin@example.com &
password = change-me

###

### Login as customer
POST http://localhost:8080/api/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

email = customer1@example.com &
password = customer123

###

### Check who's logged in
GET http://localhost:8080/api/whoami

###

### Logout
POST http://localhost:8080/api/logout

###

### Invalid registration - missing activation code
POST http://localhost:8080/api/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer2@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}